OL,3,GNEWSATown hall's roof to be repaired
OL,4,Aover eight months
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large portion of Colchester Town
OL,7,FHall's roof is due to be repaired
OL,8,Fduring an eight-month restoration
OL,9,Fproject.
OL,11,FWork to install scaffolding would begin
OL,12,Fin the coming days and would continue
OL,13,Fthroughout autumn, the city council
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FAbout 60% of the roof - which surveys
OL,17,Ffound was deteriorating - would then be
OL,18,Frepaired and restored between January
OL,19,Fand June.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
